be surprising, we aimed to intersperse moments of joy throughout the website that are both fun and engaging."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"590ff30ad09d","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"926d06df3b75","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"A website that wows"},{"_key":"7264663abc8e","_type":"workDoubleImage","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/836352708-1440p.mp4"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/836352726-1080p.mp4"}},{"_key":"21a21c7c000c","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-b7df268b4b7f8d17aae88dfa56644a7ef2377d7e-3200x1800-png","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"}}]},"orderRank":"0|10000x:f","ourProcess":{"hideProcessButton":true},"slug":{"_type":"slug","current":"litquidity"},"thumbnailContent":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1082961602","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/2014058196-fd2dc05f5d7b049ea37f73b2fbeb88b01869d8848e3efc3f1169c80388da598b-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1083700266-720p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null,"vimeoId":"1083700266"},"thumbnailCover":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-84544fee89a0fce98fe375dbae3564ed7ae760e2-3840x2560-webp","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"thumbnailExcerpt":"Rebranding the Internet's dankest financial news source.","title":"Litquidity","topSecret":false,"workHeroSection":{"backgroundColor":{"label":"Custom","value":"#ecf1ee"},"heroMedia":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-7433a68b936129250f327db1e23c790951196058-3408x2272-webp","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"image"},"sectionContent":[{"_key":"bbae32089c30","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e3e410232a970","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Litquidity isn’t just a finance meme account, it’s a media powerhouse with over 2.5 million followers, a booming newsletter (ExecSum), a podcast network, and a syndicate of private investors. As their influence grew, so did the need for a cohesive digital identity that matched the sophistication of their content. That's where we came in."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"servicesList":["Brand Identity","Web Design"],"websiteURL":"https://litquidity.co/"},"workModules":[{"_key":"2e8e51dd79f4","_type":"workTextBlock","content":[{"_key":"ec715beb6dbd","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"86114597c4e60","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"Gimetry Studio partnered with Litquidity to reimagine their brand system and create a unified web presence, one that balances edge and polish, and gives their content the credibility it deserves. We developed a flexible visual language that could stretch across platforms while still feeling unmistakably “Lit.” Clean typography, an editorial-inspired layout system, and subtle nods to financial vernacular formed the foundation."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"title":"Bringing the market to the masses"},{"_key":"d82f0113f64b","_type":"workSingleImage","media":{"_type":"media","image":{"_type":"image","asset":{"_ref":"image-a827555afdf55eb678e703117a4deb931187ad54-3840x2161-webp","_type":"reference"}},"mediaType":"video","video":"/ext/video/1081906204-2160p.mp4","videoAdaptive":null}},{"_key":"8e6c63401b34","_type":"workDouble45","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1081906179","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/2012783939-f2e4d896fd3f5c73539820c09b88354146b2f04cd466cb6156d9f73c43a48742-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1081906179-1440p.mp4","vimeoId":"1081906179"},"rightMedia":{"_type":"media","mediaType":"video","thumbnail":{"alt":"Thumbnail for Vimeo video 1081906187","url":"/ext/vimeo-img/2012783982-8f1d9fee7466557d2f5dc69797a56a60d7c7de75fa9aee68486431e30523446b-d.jpg"},"video":"/ext/video/1081906187-1440p.mp4","vimeoId":"1081906187"}},{"_key":"3c50f9b7269a","_type":"workDouble45","leftMedia":{"_type":"media","image